		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonsoir,<br /> Voici le contenu du répertoire usr/lib/python3/dist-packages/psycopg2/ :</p><p>errorcodes.py&#160; _ipaddress.py&#160; _psycopg.cpython-35m-x86_64-linux-gnu.so&#160; tests<br />extensions.py&#160; _json.py&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;__pycache__&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;tz.py<br />extras.py&#160; &#160; &#160; pool.py&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; _range.py<br />__init__.py&#160; &#160; psycopg1.py&#160; &#160; sql.py</p><p>Merci encore</p>]]></content>
